1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:05,500
Host: Welcome to a new episode of the podcast

2
00:00:05,800 --> 00:00:11,800
Host: Today we talk about the first job and salaries

3
00:00:12,500 --> 00:00:17,500
Guest: First, your CV should be one page only

4
00:00:17,800 --> 00:00:22,400
Guest: And focus on the projects you built yourself

5
00:00:22,600 --> 00:00:27,000
Guest: Companies like to see real work

6
00:00:27,500 --> 00:00:33,000
Host: And salaries? People always ask about the salary

7
00:00:38,000 --> 00:00:43,500
Guest: Honestly, the first-year salary is not the most important thing

8
00:00:43,800 --> 00:00:48,000
Guest: What matters is learning from skilled people

9
00:00:48,200 --> 00:00:52,000
Guest: After two years the salary changes a lot

10
00:00:52,500 --> 00:00:56,000
Host: Great words, thank you

11
00:00:56,300 --> 00:00:59,500
Host: See you in the next episode
